# Three Lightning orbs at end of turn, each hitting a random enemy: the wounded cultist dies to two of them.
title Death Skull
section In fights
character Defect
fight CULTISTS_NORMAL 3
wait combat-started
hand ZAP BALL_LIGHTNING DEFEND_DEFECT STRIKE_DEFECT DUALCAST
play BALL_LIGHTNING enemy 1
play ZAP
endturn
wait turn-started
hp enemy 1 6
hand STRIKE_DEFECT DEFEND_DEFECT ZAP STRIKE_DEFECT DEFEND_DEFECT
wait 1.5
caption The skull beside an enemy's HP: it dies before it acts if you end your turn now. When your random Lightning decides it, with the chance.
shot death-skull enemies + player pad 110
